  "statement": "Given n points A[1..n] in the 2-D plane, where i -th point has two attributes A[i].x and A[i].y representing x-coordinate and y-coordinate. Find 3 points A[i] , A[j] , A[k] (i, j, k are distinct) such that distance(A[i], A[j]) + distance(A[j], A[k]) + distance(A[k], A[i]) is minimized.",
